=== DEVIATIONS from PLAN.txt
  1. Validation slack: PLAN.txt allowed |diff| <= 6-digit half-unit + 1e-9; used + 5e-06 percentage points because adjusted_ohlcv.csv.gz stores price_factor with 8 significant digits (a split/bonus step inside an MA window carries up to ~5e-8 relative error). The MA code itself is identical to build_panel.roll()/seeded() (identity check above). The 1e-6-relative and +1e-9 counts are printed next to each check.
  2. Addition (descriptive, not in PLAN.txt): run.log prints the pooled rank correlation between the 27 continuous features, to show they are not 27 independent tests.
  3. Addition (descriptive, not in PLAN.txt): T5 also shows the same tradable rule on the ordinary-day placebo (fifths cut within each results season), to show whether the tradable version is specific to results.
